ins +2000 power until the end of your opponent's next turn.","trigger":""},"ST13-015":{"effect":"[Activate: Main] [Once Per Turn] This Character gains +2000 power until the start of your next turn. Then, if you have 1 or more Life cards, draw 1 card and trash 1 card from the top of your Life cards.","trigger":""},"ST13-016":{"effect":"[Rush] [On Play] Look at all of your Life cards; place 1 card at the top of your deck and place the rest back in your Life area in any order.","trigger":""},"ST13-017":{"effect":"[Counter] Up to 1 of your Leader or Characters gains +4000 power during this battle. Then, look at all of your Life cards and place them back in your Life area in any order.","trigger":"[Trigger] You may add 1 card from the top or bottom of your Life cards to your hand: Add up to 1 card from your hand to the top of your Life cards."},"ST13-018":{"effect":"[Counter] Up to 1 of your Leader or Characters gains +2000 power during this battle. Then, if you have 0 Life cards, draw 1 card.","trigger":"[Trigger] You may add 1 card from the top or bottom of your Life cards to your hand: Add up to 1 card from your hand to the top of your Life cards."},"ST13-019":{"effect":"[Main] Look at 5 cards from the top of your deck; reveal up to 1 [Sabo], [Portgas.D.Ace], or [Monkey.D.Luffy] with a cost of 5 or less and add it to your hand. Then, place the rest at the bottom of your deck in any order.","trigger":"[Trigger] Activate this card's [Main] effect."}},"rarity":{"ST13-001":"L","ST13-002":"L","ST13-003":"L","ST13-004":"C","ST13-005":"R","ST13-006":"C","ST13-007":"C","ST13-008":"SR","ST13-009":"C","ST13-010":"C","ST13-011":"SR","ST13-012":"C","ST13-013":"SR","ST13-014":"C","ST13-015":"SR","ST13-016":"C","ST13-017":"C","ST13-018":"C","ST13-019":"C"},"boosters":{}}}